{
  "id": "s1-03",
  "seasonId": "season-1",
  "episodeNumber": 3,
  "title": {
    "en": "Starting Life in Another World from Zero"
  },
  "airDate": "2016-04-17",
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Episode 3 is starting soon. Please enjoy it. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721731121306664960",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "It started! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721731235463049216",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Basically, the heroines in Arc 1 are all pretty hot-blooded. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721731376848834561",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "That sponsor card is so cheeky. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721731412848578560",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Konomi Suzuki's PV for \"Redo\" is seriously cool! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721731543589195776",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "And now, the ED! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721731601785159680",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "A-part start! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721731691069353984",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "The way she denies it sounds like an old lady, lol. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721731859999105024",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "What's on his chest is proof that he's flat broke...! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721731923886772225",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "\"I won't call you by name.\" Sharp. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721731993998757889",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "Elsa-san enters! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721732038521278466",
      "characters": [
        "Elsa Granhiert"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "Just before 5 PM. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721732087414259712",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "Spirit x  Giant x  Elf o  Human o  Beastman o  Mabeast o ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721732244683927553",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": [
        "Contracts & Spirits",
        "Mabeasts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "Subaru-kun enters the fray.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721732319833300993",
      "characters": [
        "Natsuki Subaru"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "Please keep the channel right where it is. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721732409255862272",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "Remember it as you die! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721732480596770816",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "The ice is so very beautiful. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721732543184183296",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "Elsa-san without the cloak is sexy! And the way she moves is creepy! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721732616135712770",
      "characters": [
        "Elsa Granhiert"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "text": "The spider woman really lives up to her name. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721732704924925952",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "text": "Fixed-turret heroine cannon! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721732850014298112",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "text": "Elsa-san's way of dodging there is to shave off the frozen sole of her right shoe. Just reading that hurts. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721732947846410240",
      "characters": [
        "Elsa Granhiert"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "text": "I'm clocking out a little early. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721733011830509568",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "text": "She put on the glass slipper. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721733071595147264",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "text": "By the way, Elsa-san here is fighting while sliding around on ice shoes. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721733151886696448",
      "characters": [
        "Elsa Granhiert"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "text": "\"Can't see 'em, too damn small.\" That's rich coming from you. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721733225404452865",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "text": "The movement here is amazing! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721733273638948864",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "text": "Rom-jii is putting up more of a fight than last time, too. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721733350440841216",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "text": "What the hell was that?! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721733390471278593",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "text": "Felt-chan's save! Barely... not, lol! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721733449854287877",
      "characters": [
        "Felt"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "text": "That's right, keep fighting as long as you ain't dead. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721733608881278976",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "text": "\"Haidaraa!\" I wonder how many people will get that reference. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721733687390265344",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "text": "A fierce back-and-forth is unfolding in the background. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721733761402929153",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "text": "He's not shaking now, so that's good enough! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721733814284750848",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "text": "Back in middle school, I used to make shinai about this thick and swing them around. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721733898489569282",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "text": "That save just now was probably Subaru's biggest miracle. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721734001736593408",
      "characters": [
        "Natsuki Subaru"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "text": "No, that's more your job! Use a cheat, damn it! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721734097387655168",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "text": "Looking back on everything up to this point, I don't want to see that look on her face. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721734215994179584",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "text": "Elsa-san decides to toy with them to death here. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721734311196536832",
      "characters": [
        "Elsa Granhiert"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "text": "That's far enough. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721734378783531008",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "text": "\"Sword Saint\" entry. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721734453169508352",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": [
        "Combat & Tiering"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "text": "A Part over! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721734507800309760",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "text": "Isn't that fast? ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721734555493765121",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "text": "Before everyone starts asking, I'll answer this first: Reinhard came from the roof instead of the door because he jumped from the spot where he promised Felt he'd save her and came straight to the loot house. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721734983186944002",
      "characters": [
        "Felt",
        "Reinhard van Astrea"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "text": "Confirmed: Elsa-san = the Bowel Hunter. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721735083770531840",
      "characters": [
        "Elsa Granhiert"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "text": "Elsa-san is overjoyed! Is it a festival today or what!? ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721735163965616128",
      "characters": [
        "Elsa Granhiert"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "text": "It's the B Part, but I think it'll be interesting if you pay attention to about how much Elsa-san was toying with Subaru. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721735315388370944",
      "characters": [
        "Elsa Granhiert",
        "Natsuki Subaru"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "text": "A heroine who can't be honest. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721735366772797440",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "text": "Step in, light kick, then a medium punch. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721735659099009024",
      "characters": [
        "Medium O'Connell"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "text": "Elsa-san is getting serious!　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721735725780049920",
      "characters": [
        "Elsa Granhiert"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "text": "Reinhard-san doesn't move from that spot. He doesn't need to. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721735848312446976",
      "characters": [
        "Reinhard van Astrea"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "text": "Please think of that overflowing from Reinhard-san as sword aura.  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721735944588492803",
      "characters": [
        "Reinhard van Astrea"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "text": "I love mutual introductions! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721735996585316356",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "text": "Reinhard used the command \"Heavy Punch.\" ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721736090281857024",
      "characters": [
        "Reinhard van Astrea"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "text": "H-he's not even out of breath... not even sweating...! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721736243822788608",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "text": "The period when it was growing and when it was open. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721736386957549570",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "text": "Felt, who'd been left behind, finally caught up. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721736461968486400",
      "characters": [
        "Felt"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "text": "NEXT, Elsa entry. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721736526174904320",
      "characters": [
        "Elsa Granhiert"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "text": "That's weird, her clothes aren't torn... ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721736596689563650",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "text": "Elsa-san's attack missed because of the Divine Protection of Arrow Evasion. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721736665354473472",
      "characters": [
        "Elsa Granhiert"
      ],
      "topics": [
        "Divine Protections"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "text": "Super Subaru Time! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721736722808111104",
      "characters": [
        "Natsuki Subaru"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "text": "He's moving way too noisily. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721736769452937217",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "text": "Behind-the-scenes tidbit: we recorded several different versions of \"I want you to tell me your name\" here (lol). ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721736971370901504",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "text": "Behind the scenes: yes, our heroine's name is actually Emilia. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721737066141196289",
      "characters": [
        "Emilia"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "text": "Rom-jii with perfect posture. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721737137041707008",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "text": "Reinhard's painful oversight! Subaru was weaker than he imagined! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721737213399072769",
      "characters": [
        "Natsuki Subaru",
        "Reinhard van Astrea"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "text": "Isn't it fast? ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721737261335715841",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "text": "Sorry, but even by episode 3 we couldn't fit in the OP and ED...! The main story was completely packed...! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721737413790343168",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "text": "Still, Reinhard-san is ridiculously handsome! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721737487362568196",
      "characters": [
        "Reinhard van Astrea"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "text": "Felt x Rom-jii... no, never mind. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721737560444108802",
      "characters": [
        "Felt"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "text": "Behind-the-scenes tidbit: the secret to Felt always being cute is apparently that Sakai-san took a liking to her, so a ton of effort is going into drawing her (lol). ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721737775083442180",
      "characters": [
        "Felt"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "text": "If it weren't Reinhard-san, this would be an incident. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721737848412438528",
      "characters": [
        "Reinhard van Astrea"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "text": "Behind-the-scenes detail: regarding the insignia, when Felt and Emilia are holding it, the gem in the center is...　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721737952808677376",
      "characters": [
        "Emilia",
        "Felt"
      ],
      "topics": [
        "Royal Selection"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "text": "A protagonist who moves on to Chapter 2 while still asleep. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721738008496459776",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "text": "Yes, it's Re: Life in a Different World from Zero! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721738094416777216",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "text": "Isn't it super fast? ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721738227187453952",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "text": "Behind the scenes: the sponsor card is the director's playground! Not me! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721738341872328704",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 77,
      "text": "Well then, thank you again this week for joining us for Re: Life in a Different World from Zero. As you can tell if you watched episode 3, it moved like crazy. It was insane. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721739143370317826",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 78,
      "text": "But the director and staff were saying things like, \"We couldn't really make episodes 1 and 2 move that much because we wanted to focus our effort on episode 3...\" and honestly I have no idea what they're talking about. I have no idea what they're talking about, so episode 3 moved so much it was absurd. All I can say is thank you. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721739443506253824",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 79,
      "text": "Whether you can really call it getting through safely with the protagonist's stomach split open is questionable, but Chapter 1 has ended. Next is Chapter 2. That character you've all been waiting for will appear too, so look forward to it, everyone! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721739873619546113",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 80,
      "text": "Thanks again for this week, and please join us again next week! Next time, look forward to \"Clown Makeup Supremacy\"! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/721740027575668736",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    }
  ]
}
